KaQrlRQlfijGdVu8ToZHZgvGSDfSLBQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSn4LYiXGrc6S5Vg9L2Ch3jE1Uj8CX08hDijEn4Fu3GOA&oe=6B0843C4"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1083918432800277", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210893_1083918439466943_4096975780482072563_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UbwO_7rEYHcQ7kNvwGt_v31&_nc_oc=Adr7gJMqdj41VMfnjzrPtjzIQjgfoXTE-JOxfIRF5_lhB6fH5y--Jd2dEBEWGNEEsyQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQtzovM_asHiR7yAklcnELa9EpJsWQhAnQzMXe5QR80kg&oe=6B085D2E"}, {"file_name": "6.png", "id": "1441316176805782", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003282_1441316180139115_660872075344180481_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t8ZRHQwyuS8Q7kNvwFNyex-&_nc_oc=Adpo1C0805aSra7rgVmCiJrKCCmJVyHOgQoA9nDfQ0XQjF2ypEhfL46PmFsONlpPg3s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTovxWh8uDtHBfIwLBtBbNKKC0G7BIFSBaYxq4XZFwmMQ&oe=6B084CCD"}, {"file_name": "8.png", "id": "1052888042643074", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001670_1052888055976406_3539002532750634157_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zbutWctccB8Q7kNvwHu9KC-&_nc_oc=Adoannu7a-zHaSCJSkWQoEW1Bk6G2QxzUdY2T-yOEorXwaGytmdIvGcOaPB9B0V8Bi8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSZMyTN9-tYBFtdSKbDP2ohLyWDLzRj7t6_scqjqP6HZA&oe=6B084868"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "LANDSCAPE.png", "id": "2276308399239936", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982626_2276308402573269_1803063043453586688_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vCnOugs_H3AQ7kNvwFes8mW&_nc_oc=Adp_VRj1f72_yS2dLIIcsROWyR7pMNn2bPYN6QH-pMQmLB9ouPkaLdPsLJ8jzim-3yA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ1J6gRZ5HpAsPz4rUTQyFlIolZ-yxeSKaBN_NrC_BX_A&oe=6B0858F3"}, "display_name": "Last Chance: The Survivor", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\"Last Chance: The Survivor\" is a VR-based action-shooter game that chronicles the gripping journey of Gabriel, starting as a scientist in an army laboratory and continuing as a father searching for his daughter in a post-apocalyptic world. Following a devastating catastrophe that has ravaged the world, Gabriel focuses on one sole purpose in his ruined life: finding his lost daughter. During this journey, Gabriel faces the challenges of a broken world, enduring both physical and emotional battles.\n\nFeatures:\n\nRealistic VR Experience:\nHigh-quality graphics and fluid VR mechanics for an immersive post-apocalyptic experience. Interact naturally with a world full of interactive objects and realistic physics.\n\nStrategic Combat:\nDiverse weapons for varied strategies. Defeat enemies using environmental tactics and smart resource management.\n\nDiverse Zombies:\nFace different types of zombies, each requiring unique combat approaches. From swift attackers to more formidable foes, adapt your strategy to survive.\n\nHighscore Mode:\nEndless action in Highscore Mode. Aim for high scores against increasing zombie waves. Tests shooting skills, quick thinking, and agility.\n\nVersions: \n1.0.3 - 'Highscore' and 'Training' modes are currently playable. New modes coming soon! Thanks for your feedback and support! ", "short_description": "Last Chance: The Survivor is a VR-based action-shooter game that chronicles the gripping journey of Gabriel, starting as a scientist in an army laboratory and continuing as a father searching for his daughter in a post-apocalyptic world. Following a devastating catastrophe that has ravaged the world, Gabriel focuses on one sole purpose in his ruined life: finding his lost daughter. During this journey, Gabriel faces the challenges of a broken world, enduring both physical and emotional battles."}]}, "developer_name": n